  "objectives": [
    "Describe the observed phenomenon of apparent retrograde motion and identify it in a simulated night sky",
    "Explain why the geocentric model required epicycles to account for retrograde motion",
    "Demonstrate how the heliocentric model naturally produces apparent retrograde motion through relative orbital velocities",
    "Compare the retrograde behavior of Mars, Jupiter, and Saturn and relate differences to their orbital distances from the Sun"
