        "Recognize the retrograde loop as a periodic reversal of Mars's apparent direction",
        "Describe the timeline of a retrograde event \u2014 slowing, reversal, and resumption of eastward motion"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "Press Next to advance through each stage of Mars's apparent motion.",
        "Watch how Mars's position shifts against the fixed background stars night after night.",
        "Pay attention to when Mars appears to slow, reverse, and then resume its normal direction."
