          "changeMeaning": "Scene opens with the starfield backdrop, constellation labels, and Mars placed in Leo. The narrator panel introduces the night-sky perspective. Mars is visible as a small orange-red sphere.",
          "narration": "Look up at the night sky. Over many weeks, Mars \u2014 that reddish-orange point of light \u2014 slowly drifts eastward against the background constellations. Here you can see it moving from Leo toward Virgo, night after night. This steady eastward motion is what we normally expect from an outer planet."
        },
        {
